{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_07",
  "title": "有客先來",
  "storyCode": "RI-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d0324e0c23e69494423e6701db7a5700a66ec002c8cc353485192084eda6b083",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "居然有這麼強的整合運動，哼，但是小刻不會輸的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "嘖，這個傻丫頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "唔？這裡是哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "text": "啊，是嘉維爾！還有大家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "早上好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "誒嘿嘿，博士早上好。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "唔，博士的臉色有點可怕，是我做錯了什麼嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "博士不要生氣好不好......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "（爆栗）",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "嗚嗚嗚，頭好痛，博士。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
              "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "為什麼突然敲我的頭呀......"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "精神看起來至少恢復正常了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "小刻，你還記得你怎麼來到這裡的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "......唔，忘了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "來，你先躺下，我給你看看身體還有沒有出問題，還有下次別亂跑了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "好~咦，這裡是哪裡啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "這裡是......嘖，不知道怎麼給你解釋，反正躺好就對了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "哦——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嘉維爾，你在搞什麼鬼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘖，給你解釋也很麻煩，總之你先等等。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "十分鐘後"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好了，沒什麼大礙，去博士旁邊待著，別亂跑啊，再亂跑不給你蜜餅吃了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
          "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
          "text": "哦！蜜餅！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "可以了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "可以了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "那麼，嘉維爾，你在搞什麼鬼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "唉，說起來有些複雜，總之我是來找你的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "引擎我是不會還給你的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "雖然引擎也是一件事，不過我有別的事要找你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "別的事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "你是不是讓手下去開採鐵礦了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "......嘖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嘉維爾，我沒想到你是這麼不服輸的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "被大醜打敗讓你不服氣嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "不，那個叫大醜的東西確實不賴，我心服口服。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "但如果你不惜讓手下染上礦石病也要去開採礦石的話，那我作為醫生，就必須要阻止你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嗯？礦石病？哦，你在說石頭病。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我沒有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我告訴過他們很多次不要靠近礦區深處。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "可是你的手下明明感染了礦石病！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "會有不聽話的傢伙跑進去，這個我攔不住，你說是吧，尤吉？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "尤吉",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
          "text": "是，哥哥是想多給大酋長採一些礦才冒險跑進礦區深處的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "啊？那你早說啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "尤吉",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
          "text": "你又沒問。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "這麼重要的事......！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你自己說的，礦石病在這裡不被重視。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "嘖，好吧。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "博士，我該不會真的沒問吧？！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "你確實沒問。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "嘖，博士，連你也拆我的台！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "而且......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "喂，你幹嘛突然脫衣服？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嗯？！你的身體......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我從小就一直在礦區裡到處跑，會得石頭病也是很正常的事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "但是，我也敢說，沒有人比我更瞭解礦區裡哪裡有那種會讓人得病的礦石。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "這樣啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "好吧，那是我錯怪你了，抱歉，祖瑪瑪。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "沒事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "誒，就這麼和解了？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "一般這種情況不是應該互不相讓然後大戰三百回合的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可頌",
          "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
          "text": "別期待這種事啦！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嘉維爾不是那種人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "可惜。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那我們來聊聊另一件事吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "我們的引擎在你這裡對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那個能不能還給我們？不然的話我可要回不去了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "你想回去的話，我可以讓人送你一程。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "那可不行，凱爾希會生氣的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "無論如何都不行？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "無論如何都不行。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "宴",
          "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
          "text": "哦，看起來還是要打誒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "看起來還是要動手啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "我從一開始就是這個打算。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘿，要和這傢伙打一場嗎，有意思！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嗨，你們好！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......大祭司，你怎麼這就把大醜開出來了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "什麼，不是要和嘉維爾動手嗎？不用嗎？不用我就開回去了，我還要測試引擎呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "......要，但不是現在，我還有話要說。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "噢，好吧，那你先說，要打了喊我！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "喂，剛才你們是不是提到了引擎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "沒錯，大醜身上現在就裝著你的引擎，想要的話，就用你的武力來搶吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "嘿，那就來吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "speakerId": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "跟我來，我們在廣場上決出勝負。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
